msgctxt "quest/022/JobRel200_02284:TEXT_JOBREL200_02284_SYSTEM_000_000:1"
msgid "Please note that upon completing the quest “Finding Your Voice,” you will receive an anima weapon for <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr "Обратите внимание: после завершения задания « Обрести свой голос» вы получите оружие анима для класса или профессии <if ($gn68 == 10)>«<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»<else><if ($gn68 == 14)>«<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»<else><if ($gn68 == 5)>«<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»<else><if ($gn68 == 26)>«<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»<else><if ($gn68 == 33)>«<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»<else>«<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»</if></if></if></if></if>."

#. ja: <if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>のアニマウェポンを創造しますか？
#. de: Möchtest du die Anima-Waffe für den Job <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color> herstellen?
#. fr: Améliorer l'arme anima <if ($gn4 == 0)><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 2></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if><nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/022/JobRel200_02284:TEXT_JOBREL200_02284_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Что вы будете делать?"

#. ja: もう少し悩んでみる
#. de: Nein, ich möchte den Job wechseln.
#. fr: Non
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/022/JobRel200_02284:TEXT_JOBREL200_02284_A1_000_000:1"
msgid "Undertake this quest as another job."
msgstr "Принять задание за другой класс или профессию."

#. ja: <if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if>のアニマウェポンを創造する
#. de: Ja, ich möchte den Auftrag als <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><if ($gn68 < 8)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 > 18)><sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color> weiterspielen.
#. fr: Oui
